{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/d169f679155fea08775ffc4a1091f9cc.poster.avif?t=1766219593\" width=1000 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/d169f679155fea08775ffc4a1091f9cc.webm?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/d169f679155fea08775ffc4a1091f9cc.mp4?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, you must earn enough coins to pay rent to the region\u2019s landlord or risk bankruptcy. With ever-changing market trends and unique regional conditions, adapt your strategies on each journey, chain powerful synergies, and optimize your night market to perfection to help Luxman build the world\u2019s most famous night market!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/13a4f9cc6323af397306c9014fc958a9.poster.avif?t=1766219593\" width=1000 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/13a4f9cc6323af397306c9014fc958a9.webm?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/13a4f9cc6323af397306c9014fc958a9.mp4?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spatial set-collection strategy</strong> \u2013 Master market composition by strategically placing 6 types of attractions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt to market trends</strong> \u2013 Analyze trend charts to fulfill visitor demands, fend off thugs, and tackle unique regional challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage powerful items</strong> \u2013 Push your luck with exotic Charms and manipulate spaces &amp; crowds with evolving Voucher powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat, no enemies, only demanding landlords to satisfy</strong> \u2013 Discover 11 unique landlords and uncover their intriguing stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An in-depth journey</strong> \u2013 Conquer 7 difficulties and explore endless possibilities with seeded journeys.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/fd4d19885017bc95240f56305ad313c1.poster.avif?t=1766219593\" width=1000 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/fd4d19885017bc95240f56305ad313c1.webm?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/fd4d19885017bc95240f56305ad313c1.mp4?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your perfect night market with different Trucks, Charms, Vouchers, and the Bluprint Workshop. Ignite a combo frenzy, stack game-changing synergies, and optimize your layout to turn fortune in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/eab1ca0faba5e363ccc9d2568856f936.poster.avif?t=1766219593\" width=1000 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/eab1ca0faba5e363ccc9d2568856f936.webm?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/eab1ca0faba5e363ccc9d2568856f936.mp4?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >122 Charms, each gives unique passive ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >114 Vouchers to manipulate space and crowds to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Trucks with distinct traits to shape your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Attraction Types to craft and discover 56 unique Attraction combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/d02af752668fa451d4a7a8cfd04b83c3.poster.avif?t=1766219593\" width=1000 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/d02af752668fa451d4a7a8cfd04b83c3.webm?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/d02af752668fa451d4a7a8cfd04b83c3.mp4?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in Luxman Moonlit Market\u2019s vibrant rubber hose world. Experience the festive glow of the night market, where dazzling lights, lively crowds, and whimsical characters bring every region to life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your collection and discover new experiences with every single journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your journey with the in-depth Journal, recording every item bought, sold, and used in each journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a uniquely appealing rubber hose art style, blending exotic charm with the colorful and lively atmosphere of a bustling night market.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground