4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your perfect night market with different Trucks, Charms, Vouchers, and the Bluprint Workshop. Ignite a combo frenzy, stack game-changing synergies, and optimize your layout to turn fortune in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/eab1ca0faba5e363ccc9d2568856f936.poster.avif?t=1766219593\" width=1000 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/eab1ca0faba5e363ccc9d2568856f936.webm?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/eab1ca0faba5e363ccc9d2568856f936.mp4?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >122 Charms, each gives unique passive ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >114 Vouchers to manipulate space and crowds to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Trucks with distinct traits to shape your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Attraction Types to craft and discover 56 unique Attraction combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/d02af752668fa451d4a7a8cfd04b83c3.poster.avif?t=1766219593\" width=1000 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/d02af752668fa451d4a7a8cfd04b83c3.webm?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642440/extras/d02af752668fa451d4a7a8cfd04b83c3.mp4?t=1766219593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourse